message: "If you use The Actualization Theory (AT), please cite it as below."

title: "The Actualization Theory"

abstract: >-
  The Actualization Theory (AT) reconstructs physics from the primitive
  Difference and the tensor reference η through the hierarchy
  Difference → Actualization → Inevitable Spectrum → Physics.
  The theory reconstructs quantum mechanics, gravity,
  standard-model observables, and cosmology as spectral
  readouts of the D96 spectrum.
  

