notes: >-
  The repository development line is V2.2 (New Physics program; audit lines complete
  2026-09-13). The archived, citable artifact remains the V2.0 monograph, and
  preferred-citation below points at its DOI. V2.2 adds no publication artifact and has no
  Zenodo deposit of its own. Note also that version 2.2 records three negative headline
  results: the theory's derived spatial structure is excluded by measurement (gamma = -1,
  Cassini 8.6957e4 sigma), the spatial sector cannot be derived (G_030 no-go), and the
  electromagnetic dynamics is declared but never computed (E_001). See
  Docs/Publication/RELEASE_NOTES_V2_2.md.

